@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Segoe UI
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #526B7B
skinparam activityBackgroundColor #EDF4FB
skinparam activityBorderColor #526B7B
skinparam activityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3DF
skinparam activityDiamondBorderColor #B99557

title RB-D07 — Reviewed provider send eligibility
start
if (RB-D07-C01\nSend capability valid = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D07-C02\nFinal review current = T?) then (yes)
if (RB-D07-C03\nAttempt eligible without blind\nretry = T?) then (yes)
:RB-D07-R07\nELIGIBLE SEND ATTEMPT;
stop
else (no)
if (RB-D07-C03 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D07-R05\nRECONCILE BEFORE RETRY;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D07-R06\nUNRESOLVED PRIOR EFFECT;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D07-C02 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D07-R03\nNO CURRENT SEND CONSENT;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D07-R04\nUNRESOLVED REVIEW;
stop
endif
endif
else (no)
if (RB-D07-C01 = F?) then (yes)
:RB-D07-R01\nBLOCK SEND CAPABILITY;
stop
else (U)
:RB-D07-R02\nUNPROVEN SEND CAPABILITY;
stop
endif
endif
legend bottom
Decision alternatives, not execution steps or evaluation timing.
T = established true; F = established false; U = unresolved.
Conditions and full results are defined in the rule table.
All rows here are proposed analysis refinements; no new policy acceptance.
endlegend
@enduml
